<title>UK: Lloyds TSB raises UK base rate to 6.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Lloyds TSB raises UK base rate to 6.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lloyds TSB Group Plc said on Friday it had raised its UK bank base rate by 25 basis points to 6.50 percent.</p>
<p>The move follows the Bank of England's decision to raise official rates to 6.50 percent from 6.25 percent.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
